/* Unity — Dark (Unity 6 에디터 어두운 스킨). 색·모서리 토큰만 정의한다 — 배치·모양은 Styles/*.uss 가 이 토큰을 쓴다. */
:root {
    --git-bg: #383838;
    --git-sidebar-bg: #313131;
    --git-toolbar-bg: #3c3c3c;
    --git-header-bg: #313131;
    --git-list-bg: #313131;
    --git-text: #d2d2d2;
    --git-text-muted: #9a9a9a;
    --git-border: #232323;
    --git-divider: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    --git-hover: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --git-pressed: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    --git-selected: #2c5d87;
    --git-selected-text: #ffffff;
    --git-row-alt: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    --git-accent: #3b82c4;
    --git-accent-hover: #4a90d0;
    --git-accent-text: #ffffff;
    --git-success: #3fb85c;
    --git-warning: #e0a030;
    --git-danger: #e05050;
    --git-refs: #74bfff;
    --git-badge-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    --git-field-bg: #2a2a2a;
    --git-field-border: #212121;
    --git-button-bg: #585858;
    --git-button-border: #303030;
    --git-button-hover: #676767;
    --git-radius: 3px;
    --git-state-modified: #ff9e1a;
    --git-state-added: #4dd14d;
    --git-state-deleted: #eb4d4d;
    --git-state-renamed: #59a6ff;
    --git-state-untracked: #73c991;
    --git-state-conflicted: #ff33cc;
    --git-state-text: #000000;
    --git-graph-bg: #2b2b2b;
    --git-graph-header-bg: #333333;
    --git-graph-header-border: #1f1f1f;
    --git-graph-subject: #c8c8c8;
    --git-graph-date: #d9d9d9;
    --git-graph-lane-bg: #424242;
    --git-graph-lane-text: #ebebeb;
    --git-graph-pill-bg: #4d5b73;
    --git-graph-pill-head: #33bf59;
    --git-graph-pill-tag: #d9a633;
    --git-graph-pill-text: #ffffff;
    --git-graph-empty: #8c8c8c;
    --git-graph-tooltip-bg: rgba(20,20,20,0.95);
    --git-graph-tooltip-text: #ffffff;
    --git-graph-selection: #ffffff;
    --git-graph-search: #ffe633;
    --git-graph-head: #33bf59;
    --git-graph-date-band: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    --git-graph-truncated: rgba(153,153,153,0.5);
    --git-diff-bg: #1e1e1e;
    --git-diff-added-line: rgba(46,160,67,0.18);
    --git-diff-added-change: rgba(46,160,67,0.45);
    --git-diff-removed-line: rgba(248,81,73,0.18);
    --git-diff-removed-change: rgba(248,81,73,0.45);
    --git-diff-hunk: rgba(56,139,253,0.14);
    --git-diff-hunk-text: #8ab4f8;
    --git-diff-gutter: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    --git-diff-number: #7d8590;
    --git-diff-text: #d6d6d6;
    --git-diff-empty: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    --git-diff-added-sign: #3fb950;
    --git-diff-removed-sign: #f85149;
    --git-diff-split-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
